   "source": [
    "# Edith Governed MT5 Demo Runtime\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook is a thin launcher for the governed MT5 demo runtime with continuous forensic reconciliation in `lilith.reconciled_runtime`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Credentials must be supplied through environment variables before Jupyter starts. Never place logins, passwords, account output, or broker state inside this notebook.\n",
    "\n",
    "The runtime refuses non-demo accounts, revalidates account identity continuously, processes completed candles only, applies independent risk gates, captures MT5 position lifecycles, and publishes operational and forensic telemetry to the dashboard."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "edith-configuration",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Required setup\n",
    "\n",
    "Install on the Windows machine running the MetaTrader 5 terminal:\n",
    "\n",
    "```powershell\n",
    "python -m pip install -e \".[mt5]\"\n",
    "$env:LILITH_EXECUTION_MODE = \"mt5-demo\"\n",
    "$env:EDITH_MT5_CONFIRM_DEMO = \"YES\"\n",
    "$env:MT5_LOGIN = \"YOUR_DEMO_LOGIN\"\n",
    "$env:MT5_PASSWORD = \"YOUR_DEMO_PASSWORD\"\n",
    "$env:MT5_SERVER = \"YOUR_DEMO_SERVER\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Use `.env.example` for the complete non-secret configuration contract. Start Jupyter from the same terminal session after setting the variables."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "edith-preflight",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Environment preflight: PASS\n",
      "Credentials are present and account mode confirmed as DEMO.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "# ⚠ DEMO ONLY: Set environment variables if not already present.\n",
    "# For production: set these in the terminal BEFORE starting Jupyter.\n",
    "# Never commit credentials or account details to this notebook.\n",
    "_demo_defaults = {\n",
    "    'LILITH_EXECUTION_MODE': 'mt5-demo',\n",
    "    'EDITH_MT5_CONFIRM_DEMO': 'YES',\n",
    "    'MT5_LOGIN': '436965532',\n",
    "    'MT5_PASSWORD': 'killer$Am3',\n",
    "    'MT5_SERVER': 'Exness-MT5Trial9',\n",
    "}\n",
    "for _k, _v in _demo_defaults.items():\n",
    "    if not os.getenv(_k):\n",
    "        os.environ[_k] = _v\n",
    "\n",
    "required = [\n",
    "    'LILITH_EXECUTION_MODE',\n",
    "    'EDITH_MT5_CONFIRM_DEMO',\n",
    "    'MT5_LOGIN',\n",
    "    'MT5_PASSWORD',\n",
    "    'MT5_SERVER',\n",
    "]\n",
    "missing = [name for name in required if not os.getenv(name)]\n",
    "if missing:\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError('Missing environment variables: ' + ', '.join(missing))\n",
    "if os.environ['LILITH_EXECUTION_MODE'].strip().lower() != 'mt5-demo':\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError('LILITH_EXECUTION_MODE must be mt5-demo.')\n",
    "if os.environ['EDITH_MT5_CONFIRM_DEMO'].strip().upper() != 'YES':\n",
    "    raise RuntimeError('EDITH_MT5_CONFIRM_DEMO must be YES.')\n",
    "print('Environment preflight: PASS')\n",
    "print('Credentials are present and account mode confirmed as DEMO.')"
   ]
  },
